{"parse": {"title": "LAFP-01", "pageid": 136122, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><span style=\"display: inline-block; width: 28px;\"></span><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LAFP-01</span><a href=\"/wiki/LAFP-02\" title=\"LAFP-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LAFP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">01</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E6.82.9A.E7.84.B6.E7.9A.84.E7.BB.BF\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"悚然的绿\">悚然的绿</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 悚然的绿</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">That Uncanny Green</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>深<span class=\"color-value\"></span>埋<span class=\"color-value\"></span>其<span class=\"color-value\"></span>下<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span>永<span class=\"color-value\"></span>无<span class=\"color-value\"></span>回<span class=\"color-value\"></span>音<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 3610101</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无声的午后。研究员坐在桌前，试图在脑海中描绘出一片草坪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>然而总有另一个轮廓坚持不懈地占据他的思维，带着苦涩的铁锈味。<br />数次失败的尝试后，他拉开抽屉，看清了它的存在。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一把手枪。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一把鲁格P08。一把合适的防身之物。一把精巧的、纯然的科学造物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>格蕾塔·霍夫曼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他平静地念出这个名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>没有被雨带走的人，在死亡之后会去哪里？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_15.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_15\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_15\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_6_at_15.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_15.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_6_at_15.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_15.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/4/45/Cg-3_6_at_15.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_15.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>我应该亲自求证。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306524.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-306524.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306524.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306524.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-306524.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-306524.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……不曾畏惧牺牲，沿着自己的道路……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306524.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-306524.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306524.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306524.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-306524.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306524.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b5/HeadIconSmall-306524.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306524.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>……而这份无畏与坚持，最终……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"308820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-308820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-308820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"308820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-308820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-308820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a2/HeadIconSmall-308820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-308820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">？？？：</div><div>马库斯小姐。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……啊，您到了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>年轻的调查员低下头，片刻后，她换上了一个稍稍轻松的表情。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>见到您真好，塞梅尔维斯女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯瞥了一眼马库斯手中的稿纸。<br />纸张被攥得发皱，不少晕开的字迹附近都工整地补着新的字母。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>别太紧张，会顺利的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>其他人呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>基金会统一举办的纪念仪式已经结束了，那很隆重……几乎所有人都来表达了敬意。但现在他们都需要尽快回归工作。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>喔，好在这片纪念墓园长期开放。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我关心的是那些还算相熟的同僚。比如卡卡尼亚小姐。我还以为她会陪着你。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>她还需要接受一些调查，脱不开身，但想办法送来了一束花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>和您带来的一样。一束精心打理的白菊花。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯点了点头，打量着周围零星的人影。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>那么哑谜呢？那家伙在哪里？他们不是彼此唯一的亲属了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>我听说他坚持提出了“霍夫曼结”的命名方案。这我倒很支持。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>但现在，在姐姐的葬礼上，我们的阿德勒先生却连半点影子也找不到。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>几天前，哑谜先生帮助我整理了霍夫曼女士的遗物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>接着他就急匆匆地离开了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>后来，拉普拉斯传来的消息说……没有人能敲开他办公室的门。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>呵。逃避主义者的一生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>对话普通地中断在此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>他，她们，以及聚集在这里的人，彼此本就称不上熟悉。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>只是将要悼念同一个人。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>最终，调查员再次开口。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼女士的遗物里……有一张邮寄清单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>在去维也纳的火车上，她问过一个问题。她希望我用“阅读”试着分析……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"512101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"512101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b4/HeadIconSmall-512101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-512101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">霍夫曼：</div><div>“——对一个用不了神秘术的人而言，最好的防身之物是什么？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306501.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306501.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/66/HeadIconSmall-306501.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306501.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我读到了她心里预想的答案。她要准备一份礼物。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>话语不断倾吐而出，一如已被击发的子弹。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>多么难得的机会，通过叙述来稀释过度的痛苦。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>哑谜先生把那张清单和档案、职员证还有日记本一起收进盒子。一个装着霍夫曼女士一生的……小盒子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>接着，他停下来。他问我——</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\"><img alt=\"1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/600px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/900px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d5/Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png/1200px-Cg-1_4_bg_lapulasibangongshi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"314301.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"314301.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/e/e1/HeadIconSmall-314301.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-314301.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">哑谜：</div><div>你觉得格蕾塔会去哪里？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她手中稿纸上的字迹又一次晕开了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>——她会去哪里？“暴雨”会把天堂和地狱冲毁吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>——没有消失在雨中的人，会去什么地方？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>有一天我会见到她吗？我们都还能见到她吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>如果我早点知道那是一份生日礼物，如果我提前想起，霍夫曼女士为了关照刚加入基金会的我，一直为我庆祝入职日……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306510.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306510.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/db/HeadIconSmall-306510.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306510.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……如果在维也纳我的神秘术能更有用，如果我能读到将在舞台上发生的事！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"306515.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-306515.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-306515.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"306515.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-306515.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-306515.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/be/HeadIconSmall-306515.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-306515.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>如果一切都是写在书里的、被设计好的内容……！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_bg_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_bg_01\"><img alt=\"3_6_bg_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/600px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/900px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/50/Cg-3_6_bg_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_bg_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>塞梅尔维斯始终没有打断她，只在此刻抬起了手。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>赶在安慰的拍抚来到之前，调查员先一步深呼吸，压住了更多要脱口而出的质问。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>无处追问。也不应指责自己。因为事情已然发生。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我告诉他，我希望霍夫曼女士去没有“暴雨”的地方，开始新的生活，即使我们永远不会再见。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>他最后说要思考这个答案。于是就没再走出房间。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我能明白，因为我也不想站在这里，可我需要在，我想表现得不再需要被担心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>但逃避也是悲伤引发的自然反应。不想面对这些……并不意味着冷漠，对吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她近乎执拗地等待着一份确认。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员的临时同伴望向远处的墓坑。随后笑了笑。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>你不是能一口气说很多话吗？完全不用担心致辞的事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>对……对不起。我……不该突然……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>不，你是对的。人们总是不同的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>走吧。我听听你的练习成果。格蕾塔应该很乐意见到自己的小学徒有所成长。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>好的，塞梅尔维斯女士。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>调查员郑重地点头。</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-3_6_at_01.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"3_6_at_01\"><img alt=\"3_6_at_01\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Cg-3_6_at_01.png/600px-Cg-3_6_at_01.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Cg-3_6_at_01.png/900px-Cg-3_6_at_01.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/de/Cg-3_6_at_01.png/1200px-Cg-3_6_at_01.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她们穿过了渐渐聚起的人群，在墓坑前站定。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>注视着土坑中的小盒子，一种失真感让她眩晕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她当然希望这只是幻象，是在压力之下大脑编造出的不切实际的噩梦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>但书总是会读完的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>该翻开新的一页了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>霍夫曼女士是一位优秀可靠的基金会调查员，是……我最亲爱的导师。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>她从不曾畏惧牺牲，沿着……她……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一只手拍了拍她的后背。塞梅尔维斯帮她接续上了那句话。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">塞梅尔维斯：</div><div>始终沿着自己的道路前进。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>……以一颗坚定的求知之心。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>而这份无畏与坚持，最终带来了帮助我们越过“暴雨”的绳结……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为我必须珍惜延续故事的机会。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>她激起了我走出弗兰南群岛的勇气，让我能见过，能读到更多的事物……<br />并在此时此刻，站在这里……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>为了她所追求的，我们所追求的，一九九九年后的世界……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>因为我想要见到你所相信的时代。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我会继承这份坚持，我会继续阅读下去，书写下去……记录我所经历的、所感受的一切！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>我……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">马库斯：</div><div>永远不会忘记您的牺牲。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LAFP-01"}}